+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.105.3`: _the keystore operation failed because `reason`_.
-     entry .communicable   renders each reason as a message
-     entry .Reason   why the operation failed
-         `Unreadable` (1): _the keystore could not be read with the given password_ — a wrong
-         password or a corrupt store, deliberately not distinguished. `WriteUnsupported` (2):
-         _keystores cannot yet be opened for writing_, for an `open[Keystore](Write, …)`.
-     entry #reason   why the operation failed
+         Fehler `↯/s.105.3`: _the keystore operation failed because `reason`_.
+     entry .communicable   rendert jeden Grund als Meldung
+     entry .Reason   warum die Operation scheiterte
+         `Unreadable` (1): _the keystore could not be read with the given password_ — ein
+         falsches Passwort oder ein beschädigter Store, bewusst nicht unterschieden.
+         `WriteUnsupported` (2): _keystores cannot yet be opened for writing_, für ein
+         `open[Keystore](Write, …)`.
+     entry #reason   warum die Operation scheiterte

